+`-reimsnoastc` rejects known ASTC texture allocation records in the guest
+driver before publishing their host objects. Use it only for a host GPU whose
+Vulkan format queries reject ASTC. It does not decode textures, return fake
+completions, or replace draws with no-ops. The caller receives an allocation
+failure and may choose another format; applications that require ASTC remain
+unsupported. Apple GPU family claims are unchanged. Native allocation and
+application recovery must be qualified separately on the target guest.
+
 The common path includes WindowServer and requires the host runtime to
 implement its render operations, including blended framebuffer fetch.
 Current global-path qualification is in progress. Historical browser-only
